  "details": "I have a download size limit. I couldn't see the information for the imposter avatar, so I'd like to be able to see it even for people who hide their avatars or use imposter avatars.\n\n——\n\nAs a prerequisite, I don't want to download large avatar files. Therefore, I've limited the size of both the compressed and uncompressed files.\n\nDue to some restriction, I wanted to check the information of someone whose avatar was set to an imposter avatar, but the button to display avatar information was disabled, so I couldn't check it and had no choice but to download a huge avatar to check.\n\nOne thing I'd like to see improved is a way to check the information about the avatar a person is using, even if their avatar is hidden or an imposter avatar is displayed.",
